cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "POLARIS: Cross-Temporal Landmark Matching"
message: >-
  If you use this repository, please cite the entry below for the
  cross-temporal matching work, and cite the upstream FastVLM and LLaVA
  projects listed under references for the components it builds on.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Patherya
    given-names: Kausar
repository-code: https://github.com/kpatherya/polaris
url: https://github.com/kpatherya/polaris
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-10
license: Apache-2.0
references:
  - type: software
    title: "FastVLM: Efficient Vision Encoding for Vision Language Models"
    repository-code: https://github.com/apple/ml-fastvlm
    license: Apache-2.0
    notes: >-
      Upstream project. This repository is a derivative of it. Model weights
      are covered separately by LICENSE_MODEL (Apple Machine Learning Research
      Model license, research use only).
  - type: software
    title: "LLaVA: Large Language and Vision Assistant"
    repository-code: https://github.com/haotian-liu/LLaVA
    license: Apache-2.0
    notes: The bundled llava/ tree derives from this project.
